# Generated test/pipeline data. Tests write GDS files + build-key sidecars under
# tempdir() (already outside the repo); dev/benchmark + pipeline runs write them
# under dev/scratch/ (ignored above). These globs are a belt-and-suspenders
# guard so a GDS or raw IDAT written anywhere in the tree -- e.g. a pipeline run
# launched from the repo root -- can never be accidentally committed. fastMethyl
# neither ships nor commits GDS or IDAT files.
*.gds
*.gds.buildkey.rds
*.idat
*.idat.gz
